WEBVTT

00:08:29.755 --> 00:08:31.549
it's the flavors we know.

00:08:32.341 --> 00:08:35.302
Up and down the aisles till I hit it.

00:08:35.761 --> 00:08:39.014
My favorite section
of the grocery store as a kid,

00:08:39.056 --> 00:08:40.224
the cereal aisle.

00:08:41.517 --> 00:08:43.644
Now as a kid, my mom and I
had an agreement.

00:08:43.686 --> 00:08:45.145
I was a pretty picky eater,

00:08:45.187 --> 00:08:48.691
and we agreed that I could have
as much cereal as I wanted

00:08:48.691 --> 00:08:51.110
as long as I drank
all the calcium-rich milk

00:08:51.110 --> 00:08:52.861
at the bottom of the bowl.

00:08:53.237 --> 00:08:55.406
I mean, I thought it was highway robbery.

00:08:55.447 --> 00:09:00.119
Does she not understand how good
that sugary sweet milk was at the bottom?